The Slipseer was a lieutenant of [[People/Althane/Karkov|Karkov]] in the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]], an elven woman to the eye and a sovereign dragon in truth, carrying an ancient sovereign dragon heart. She wore the house's uniform and worked beside his desk, reading the dossier the House kept on [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. She was [[People/Althane/Rampart|Rampart]]'s sister, and Karkov raised the two of them as his wards.

She was a scryer, and reached after the Weft from a distance. When [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]] turned one of her spells back on her, he saw her in the room with Karkov, and she came away unable to scry him for a week.

She died at [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/RC3|RC3]] and came apart where she stood. The Weft had taken her for a vampire, and were wrong.
